{"id":"635109","name":"锅巴菜","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/635109/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小米煎饼","amount":"1人份"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"2棵"},{"name":"八角","amount":"1个"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"50克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材准备好，香菜根和香菜叶切好分开。","img":"images/635109/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"芝麻酱和腐乳混合，放入1–2勺纯净水稀释备用。","img":"images/635109/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起油锅放入食用油，油热后放入八角和香菜根。","img":"images/635109/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"炒出香味后倒入酱油。","img":"images/635109/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入甜面酱。","img":"images/635109/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/635109/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入适量清水烧开。","img":"images/635109/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"淋入水淀粉。","img":"images/635109/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"汤汁浓稠关火出锅。","img":"images/635109/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入碗中。","img":"images/635109/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入煎饼。","img":"images/635109/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"撒上香菜叶。","img":"images/635109/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"淋入调好的料汁。","img":"images/635109/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"趁热吃。","img":"images/635109/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}